    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Seeing the Shape of the JSON\r\n\r\n\r\n### **Do This:**\r\n\r\nUse different colors to highlight and label:\r\n\r\n* Array (Container): The symbols that enclose the full dataset.\r\n\r\n* Objects (Entities): The symbols that define a single pet entry.\r\n\r\n* Nested Structures: An object or array contained within another object.\r\n\r\n* Strings: Text values.\r\n\r\n* Numbers: Numeric values.\r\n\r\n* Booleans: Logical values (true / false).\r\n\r\nFocus on identifying patterns that organize the data.",
